{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"x":0.79029126405515226,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11456310272216796,"c":1,"y":0.037790697962959974,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"w":0.32233009338378904,"h":0.0174635949535904,"x":0.071844661950066169,"y":0.087209302209716899,"c":1,"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?"},{"w":0.83300969441731754,"c":1,"h":0.015988371899566256,"t":"IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language","y":0.12645348846670668,"x":0.06990291967401438},{"x":0.069902920423276477,"h":0.017579511838538675,"c":1,"y":0.14534883709652502,"w":0.80194173177083328,"t":"ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,"},{"y":0.16417445481273041,"w":0.80582524617513007,"h":0.017511591807332749,"c":1,"t":"Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All","x":0.071844658368745609},{"x":0.058190177327605473,"t":"• scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's nationality,","y":0.18058905005829073,"c":1,"h":0.020020189612082628,"w":0.84675430297851562},{"t":"first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive","c":1,"w":0.77475728352864581,"y":0.20203488381559309,"x":0.069902911533637466,"h":0.016033652118433328},{"c":1,"x":0.069902919760526455,"y":0.21947674407128659,"w":0.83300969441731787,"h":0.017594907291210271,"t":"statement which gives a summary of the English-language ability of a candidate classified at"},{"h":0.017441859497830836,"w":0.66407765706380206,"y":0.23691860491678229,"c":1,"t":"that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","x":0.069902918361302871},{"w":0.76321166992187495,"t":"Expert user - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate","y":0.28628894551405404,"h":0.019154348403122468,"c":1,"x":0.11645205913198708},{"w":0.3631067911783854,"x":0.11650485674090438,"y":0.30654205604210183,"t":"and fluent with complete understanding.","h":0.016199376947040434,"c":1},{"h":0.018975628053659266,"c":1,"x":0.069859358303704461,"t":"8 Very good user - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional","y":0.33418914246708886,"w":0.83309244791666659},{"h":0.017518836761189371,"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in","c":1,"x":0.11650485144603749,"y":0.35319767425675819,"w":0.72427185058593746},{"w":0.61941747029622385,"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","y":0.37196261694232291,"c":1,"x":0.10679611907892313,"h":0.017572266884681831},{"x":0.099029133774403047,"y":0.40116279097118734,"t":"Good user - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional","w":0.74563105265299479,"c":1,"h":0.018895348284474811},{"y":0.4214953273906823,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally","c":1,"x":0.11650484439432147,"h":0.017458161089650481,"w":0.74757283528645835},{"h":0.017454538909816963,"y":0.43894081002856189,"c":1,"w":0.61941747029622396,"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning.","x":0.11650485709011747},{"x":0.10679611099991916,"y":0.46791277267901821,"c":1,"w":0.76116505940755208,"h":0.017552343707218254,"t":"Competent user - Has generally effective command of the language despite some"},{"c":1,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","x":0.11650485675197568,"y":0.48691588769570282,"w":0.76310679117838554,"h":0.019003115264797477},{"c":1,"x":0.11650484316456115,"t":"complex language, particularly in familiar situations.","w":0.46601943969726561,"h":0.017550532617301551,"y":0.50581395337335289},{"h":0.01745272781990026,"y":0.5348837208173286,"c":1,"x":0.10873786990501381,"t":"Modest user - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning","w":0.75145629882812504},{"y":0.55232558166096835,"h":0.017456349999733778,"t":"in most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle","x":0.11650485502264435,"w":0.75728154500325529,"c":1},{"w":0.30702809651692708,"t":"basic communication in own field.","x":0.11641405398056662,"h":0.017402845008350987,"c":1,"y":0.56986459394943956},{"x":0.069902916705976662,"w":0.75728154500325517,"c":1,"t":"4 Limited user - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent","y":0.60029069776875366,"h":0.015988371899566145},{"h":0.019332391376435942,"c":1,"w":0.7302292378743489,"t":"problems in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","y":0.61875463709148615,"x":0.11450572776888521},{"c":1,"w":0.74757283528645835,"h":0.017476273177197355,"t":"Extremely limited user - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very","x":0.11262134924337393,"y":0.64825581384047104},{"x":0.11650486561469676,"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","y":0.66715116288437504,"c":1,"w":0.59029123942057293,"h":0.016026407164576595},{"h":0.013081395514657479,"y":0.69622093004063634,"c":1,"w":0.015533979733784994,"t":"2","x":0.069902912948641496},{"y":0.69470404986327527,"h":0.017505252398434368,"c":1,"t":"Intermittent user - Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.","x":0.11456311320940463,"w":0.74368932088216155},{"x":0.11650485948415583,"c":1,"t":"Non-user - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few","y":0.72383720918219518,"w":0.72621358235677091,"h":0.017595812836168734},{"y":0.7427332891042544,"t":"isolated words.","h":0.016126033747307589,"w":0.14035606384277344,"x":0.11625907733546287,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016199376947040434,"y":0.77165109016009059,"w":0.56699030558268215,"t":"0 Did not attempt the test - Did not answer the questions.","x":0.069902905357191736},{"x":0.88932038867679697,"y":0.9549418602731945,"w":0.015533979733785008,"t":"7","c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759}]}